@startuml
title 用户生命周期状态图 (User State Machine)
hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  ArrowColor Black
}

state "未注册(Unregistered)" as Unregistered
state "已注册(Registered)" as Registered
state "已登录(Logged In)" as LoggedIn
state "已登出(Logged Out)" as LoggedOut
state "已禁用(Disabled)" as Disabled

[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Registered : 注册成功 (UC-01)
Registered --> LoggedIn : 登录成功 (UC-02)
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : 主动退出(UC-12)
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : 重新登录

' 封禁逻辑
Registered --> Disabled : 系统封禁
LoggedIn --> Disabled : 违规被强制封禁
Disabled --> Registered : 系统解封 (恢复到未登录状态)


note right of LoggedIn
  用户在此状态下可执行：
  - 创建记录
  - 评论/点赞
  - 收藏
end note

@enduml